{"seq":1,"slug":"logging-metrics-tracing","title":"日志、指标与链路追踪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/observability-and-reliability/logging-metrics-tracing","wordCount":803,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"日志-指标与链路追踪\">日志、指标与链路追踪</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在分布式系统中，理解运行状态需要三种互补的信号——它们各自回答不同的问题，缺一不可。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>日志（Logs）</strong>：回答&quot;发生了什么&quot;，事件级粒度、存储成本高，用于错误排查与审计；现代系统应输出结构化 JSON 而非纯文本。</li>\n<li><strong>指标（Metrics）</strong>：回答&quot;系统状态如何&quot;，聚合级粒度、存储成本低，用于告警与趋势分析；关注四种黄金信号（延迟、流量、错误率、饱和度）。</li>\n<li><strong>链路追踪（Traces）</strong>：回答&quot;请求经过了哪里&quot;，请求级粒度，用于性能分析与瓶颈定位；核心概念是 traceId 串联、span 表示单次操作。</li>\n<li><strong>Prometheus 指标类型</strong>：counter（只增）、gauge（可增可减）、histogram（桶计数）、summary（分位数）。</li>\n<li><strong>告警原则</strong>：告警疲劳是最大敌人——只对需要人工干预的事件告警，基于症状而非原因，并分级（P0 呼叫 / P1 通知 / P2 工单）。</li>\n<li><strong>OpenTelemetry</strong> 正在成为统一采集日志、指标与追踪的事实标准。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性的三大支柱\">可观测性的三大支柱</h2><p>在分布式系统中，理解系统的运行状态需要三种互补的信号：日志（Logs）、指标（Metrics）和链路追踪（Traces）。它们各自回答不同的问题：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    O((可观测性))&#10;    L[日志 Logs&lt;br/&gt;发生了什么？]&#10;    M[指标 Metrics&lt;br/&gt;系统状态如何？]&#10;    T[链路追踪 Traces&lt;br/&gt;请求经过了哪里？]&#10;&#10;    O --- L&#10;    O --- M&#10;    O --- T&#10;&#10;    L --&gt; LE[错误详情、审计记录&lt;br/&gt;调试信息]&#10;    M --&gt; ME[请求量、延迟分位&lt;br/&gt;CPU/内存使用率]&#10;    T --&gt; TE[跨服务调用链&lt;br/&gt;延迟分布、瓶颈定位]\">graph TB\n    O((可观测性))\n    L[日志 Logs&lt;br/&gt;发生了什么？]\n    M[指标 Metrics&lt;br/&gt;系统状态如何？]\n    T[链路追踪 Traces&lt;br/&gt;请求经过了哪里？]\n\n    O --- L\n    O --- M\n    O --- T\n\n    L --&gt; LE[错误详情、审计记录&lt;br/&gt;调试信息]\n    M --&gt; ME[请求量、延迟分位&lt;br/&gt;CPU/内存使用率]\n    T --&gt; TE[跨服务调用链&lt;br/&gt;延迟分布、瓶颈定位]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>数据类型</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>存储成本</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>日志</td>\n<td>文本/结构化</td>\n<td>事件级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>错误排查、审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指标</td>\n<td>数值（时序）</td>\n<td>聚合级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>告警、趋势分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链路追踪</td>\n<td>结构化</td>\n<td>请求级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>性能分析、依赖映射</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"日志-logging\">日志（Logging）</h2><h3 id=\"结构化日志\">结构化日志</h3><p>现代系统应该使用结构化日志（JSON 格式），而非纯文本日志：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface LogEntry {&#10;  timestamp: string;&#10;  level: &#39;debug&#39; | &#39;info&#39; | &#39;warn&#39; | &#39;error&#39;;&#10;  service: string;&#10;  traceId: string;&#10;  spanId: string;&#10;  message: string;&#10;  context: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class StructuredLogger {&#10;  private service: string;&#10;&#10;  constructor(service: string) {&#10;    this.service = service;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  info(message: string, context: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt; = {}): void {&#10;    this.write(&#39;info&#39;, message, context);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  error(message: string, error: Error, context: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt; = {}): void {&#10;    this.write(&#39;error&#39;, message, {&#10;      ...context,&#10;      errorName: error.name,&#10;      errorMessage: error.message,&#10;      stackTrace: error.stack,&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private write(level: LogEntry[&#39;level&#39;], message: string, context: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;): void {&#10;    const entry: LogEntry = {&#10;      timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),&#10;      level,&#10;      service: this.service,&#10;      traceId: (context.traceId as string) ?? &#39;unknown&#39;,&#10;      spanId: (context.spanId as string) ?? &#39;unknown&#39;,&#10;      message,&#10;      context,&#10;    };&#10;    console.log(JSON.stringify(entry));&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;const logger = new StructuredLogger(&#39;order-service&#39;);&#10;logger.info(&#39;Order created&#39;, { orderId: &#39;ord_123&#39;, userId: &#39;usr_456&#39;, amount: 99.99 });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LogEntry</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'debug'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'info'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'error'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  service</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  traceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  spanId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StructuredLogger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> service</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">service</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></spa