;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    span.duration </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> span.startTime;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"opentelemetry\">OpenTelemetry</h3><p>OpenTelemetry 是当前可观测性领域的事实标准，统一了日志、指标和追踪的采集：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    App[应用] --&gt; SDK[OpenTelemetry SDK]&#10;    SDK --&gt; Collector[OTel Collector]&#10;    Collector --&gt; Jaeger[Jaeger&lt;br/&gt;链路追踪]&#10;    Collector --&gt; Prometheus[Prometheus&lt;br/&gt;指标]&#10;    Collector --&gt; Loki[Loki&lt;br/&gt;日志]\">flowchart LR\n    App[应用] --&gt; SDK[OpenTelemetry SDK]\n    SDK --&gt; Collector[OTel Collector]\n    Collector --&gt; Jaeger[Jaeger&lt;br/&gt;链路追踪]\n    Collector --&gt; Prometheus[Prometheus&lt;br/&gt;指标]\n    Collector --&gt; Loki[Loki&lt;br/&gt;日志]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((可观测性三支柱))&#10;    日志&#10;      结构化 JSON&#10;      ELK Stack&#10;      错误排查 审计&#10;    指标&#10;      四种黄金信号&#10;      Prometheus + Grafana&#10;      告警与监控&#10;    链路追踪&#10;      分布式请求链路&#10;      OpenTelemetry&#10;      性能瓶颈定位\">mindmap\n  root((可观测性三支柱))\n    日志\n      结构化 JSON\n      ELK Stack\n      错误排查 审计\n    指标\n      四种黄金信号\n      Prometheus + Grafana\n      告警与监控\n    链路追踪\n      分布式请求链路\n      OpenTelemetry\n      性能瓶颈定位</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>日志</strong>记录离散事件，用于错误排查和审计——使用结构化日志。</li>\n<li><strong>指标</strong>衡量系统趋势，用于告警和容量规划——关注四种黄金信号。</li>\n<li><strong>链路追踪</strong>展示请求的跨服务路径，用于性能分析和依赖映射。</li>\n<li><strong>OpenTelemetry</strong> 正在成为可观测性的统一标准。</li>\n<li>三者结合才能提供完整的系统可见性——缺一不可。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"日志、指标与链路追踪","id":"日志-指标与链路追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性的三大支柱","id":"可观测性的三大支柱"},{"level":2,"text":"日志（Logging）","id":"日志-logging"},{"level":3,"text":"结构化日志","id":"结构化日志"},{"level":3,"text":"日志聚合架构（ELK Stack）","id":"日志聚合架构-elk-stack"},{"level":2,"text":"指标（Metrics）","id":"指标-metrics"},{"level":3,"text":"四种黄金信号","id":"四种黄金信号"},{"level":3,"text":"Prometheus 指标类型","id":"prometheus-指标类型"},{"level":3,"text":"监控与告警","id":"监控与告警"},{"level":2,"text":"链路追踪（Distributed Tracing）","id":"链路追踪-distributed-tracing"},{"level":3,"text":"追踪模型","id":"追踪模型"},{"level":3,"text":"OpenTelemetry","id":"opentelemetry"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Serverless 与 FaaS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/architecture-patterns/serverless-and-faas"},"next":{"title":"限流与熔断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/observability-and-reliability/rate-limiting-and-circuit-breakers"}}